    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23978" root="صدغ" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْدَغَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A pillow,</i> or <i>cushion;</i> (S, O, K;) because placed beneath the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُدْغ</span> [or temple]; also
pronounced <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْدَغَةٌ</span>; and sometimes they said
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِزْدَغَةٌ</span>; (S, O;) and [↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْدَغٌ</span></b>  and] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْدَغٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِزْدَغٌ</span> signify the same. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سدغ</span>.)

